NOTE: the lengths of the 0.750" o.d. sections have
been reduced by the lengths of the 2.9447" o.d.
sections to simulate 5" x 6" x 0.375" plates.
These elements are medium-duty (80 mph).

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 7.6 dBi.
